[ti:A Heart Full of Light]
[ar:for Shayan]

[00:00.00]
[00:06.00]there are people the world grows softer for holding
[00:14.00]and you have always been one of them
[00:22.00]
[00:28.00]you stayed gentle on the days that would have hardened anyone
[00:37.00]you stayed kind while your own body grew tired
[00:46.00]
[00:52.00]so if the night ever feels too long
[01:00.00]come back here, and remember
[01:07.00]
[01:13.00]you are loved beyond measure
[01:20.00]not for what you can carry
[01:27.00]but for the soul you simply are
[01:35.00]
[01:42.00]keep shining, gentle one
[01:49.00]the world is brighter for having you in it
[01:58.00]
